id=mali_r38p1_vk13
name=Mali r38p1 DDK + Vulkan 1.3 (SurfaceFlinger on SkiaVK)
version=v6-vulkan
versionCode=2025110805
author=Mix-Kernel
description=r38p1 GLES/Vulkan 64+32bit, r38p1 vulkan.mali.so ICD, libgpudshim, Vulkan 1.3.0 feature declaration. Adds the Vulkan ICD, which makes SurfaceFlinger pick the Skia Vulkan render engine. Includes the r38p1 vendor EGL config properties (ro.vendor.arm.egl.configs.*).
